# 🛸 Skyphor — LiDAR Mission Planner

**presented by Charlie Brooks**

A standalone, browser-based LiDAR drone mission planning tool. No installation, no server, no API keys required — open `index.html` and fly.

---

## ✨ Features

### ✏️ Flight Path Planning
- Click-to-draw waypoint paths on a live satellite/street/terrain map
- Draggable waypoint markers with real-time path and swath updates
- Rubber-band preview line while drawing
- Undo last point · Clear all · Double-click to finish path

### 📡 LiDAR Swath Visualization
- Three FOV modes: **60° Narrow · 70° Medium · 90° Wide**
- Live corridor polygon with rounded end-caps and accurate turn geometry
- Swath width auto-calculated from altitude and FOV angle
- Live HUD: swath width, FOV, altitude, speed

### ⏸ Waypoint Dwell Pause
- Set **2s / 5s / 8s** hover at every waypoint
- Embedded as `gx:Wait` tags in exported KMZ (recognized by Google Earth and compatible GCS software)
- Mission time estimate includes dwell overhead

### 📊 Mission Stats
- Waypoint count, total path distance (km), LiDAR coverage area (ha), estimated flight time

### ⬇️ Export
- **Google Earth KMZ** — flight path + LiDAR swath polygon, opens directly in Google Earth
- Filename includes FOV, altitude, pause duration, and date

### ⬆️ Import
- Drag-and-drop or file-picker import of `.kmz` and `.kml` files
- Parses LineString, Point placemarks, and raw coordinate blocks

### 🌤 Weather Briefing
- 7-day forecast panel powered by [Open-Meteo](https://open-meteo.com/) (free, no key)
- Auto-detects your location via browser geolocation
- City search via Nominatim
- **Flight suitability badge** — evaluates wind, gusts, precipitation, and weather code
- Per-day fly / caution / no-fly indicators

### ✈️ Sectional Chart & Airspace
- FAA/Esri World Navigation Charts tile layer
- OpenAIP airspace overlay (Class B/C/D/E, TFRs, MOAs, Prohibited/Restricted, UAS Facility Maps)
- Independent opacity sliders for chart and airspace layers
- Click-to-inspect FAA airspace at any map point
- Toggle individual airspace classes on/off

### 🗺 Map Layers
- Satellite (Esri/Maxar)
- Street (Esri World Street)
- Terrain/Topo (Esri World Topo)
- FAA Sectional Chart

### 🔍 Location Search
- Nominatim-powered search — no API key required

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Option 1 — Open locally
```
Download index.html → open in any modern browser
```

### Option 2 — GitHub Pages (recommended)
1. Fork or clone this repo
2. Go to **Settings → Pages**
3. Set source to `main` branch, `/ (root)`
4. Your planner will be live at `https://yourusername.github.io/skyphor/`

### Option 3 — Any static host
Upload `index.html` to Netlify, Vercel, Cloudflare Pages, or any static host. No build step needed.

---

## ⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts

| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `D` | Draw mode |
| `P` | Pan mode |
| `1` | FOV 60° |
| `2` | FOV 70° |
| `3` | FOV 90° |
| `Ctrl+Z` | Undo last waypoint |
| `Escape` | Switch to pan mode |
| `S` | Toggle sectional chart panel |

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

| Component | Library / Source |
|-----------|-----------------|
| Map | [Leaflet](https://leafletjs.com/) 1.9.4 |
| KMZ packaging | [JSZip](https://stuk.github.io/jszip/) 3.10.1 |
| Satellite tiles | Esri World Imagery (ArcGIS) |
| Sectional charts | FAA AeroNav via Esri World Navigation Charts |
| Airspace overlay | [OpenAIP](https://www.openaip.net/) public tiles |
| Weather data | [Open-Meteo](https://open-meteo.com/) — free, no key |
| Geocoding / search | [Nominatim](https://nominatim.org/) — free, no key |
| Fonts | Google Fonts — Barlow Condensed + JetBrains Mono |

**Zero backend. Zero API keys. One HTML file.**

