## ⚠️ Disclaimer

Skyphor is a planning and visualization aid only. Always verify airspace, weather, and flight regulations with official sources before flying:

- [FAA B4UFLY](https://www.faa.gov/uas/recreational_fliers/where_can_i_fly/b4ufly/)
- [SkyVector](https://skyvector.com/)
- [AirMap](https://airmap.com/)

The creator is not responsible for any flight violations or incidents resulting from use of this tool.

